## System 命名空间（.NET 互操作）

```js
var now = System.DateTime.Now.ToString('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss');
var guid = System.Guid.NewGuid().ToString();
var num = System.Convert.ToInt32('123');
var rounded = System.Math.Round(3.14159, 2);
```

